The Python modules in this directory are copied from
openai/guided-diffusion (https://github.com/openai/guided-diffusion), which is
distributed under the MIT licence reproduced in LICENSE.

Copied: unet.py, gaussian_diffusion.py, respace.py, nn.py, losses.py, fp16_util.py, logger.py
Copied on: 2026-09-03
Reason: the upstream package depends on mpi4py and blobfile, which are only used by its
training and data-loading code. Vendoring the sampling subset keeps neodisco installable
with pip alone.

Local modification: nn.py routes activation checkpointing through PyTorch's maintained
non-reentrant torch.utils.checkpoint API. The model architecture and checkpoint state
dictionary keys are unchanged.
